This distribution contains the Pi-Lane and RTL-Closure components. Their
component-level NOTICE files are included at `pi-lane/NOTICE` and
`rtl-closure/NOTICE` and form part of this distribution's notices.

SiliconWeaver interoperates with Pi and LibreLane through their public command,
extension, and container interfaces. Those projects are not bundled into the
Python distributions in this repository.
